Upload Wts Cfg File
    [Documentation]    [PRIVATE]    upload wts cfg file
    ...       :Autor: Sylvia Schneider
    [Arguments]   ${wts_file}=${resultBaseDir}/basic_wts_CB008127.cfg
    Log To Console    \nupload wts file ${wts_file}
    wts_ue.Upload Customized WTS Config    config_path=${wts_file}


Update Wts File For AA t3
    [Documentation]    [PRIVATE]    update wts cfg file for AA t3
    ...       :Autor: Sylvia Schneider
    Log To Console    \nupdate wts
    ${wtsconfig}   wts_ue.Get WTS Config    target_dir=${resultBaseDir}
    wts.Load wts cfg             ${wtsconfig}

    wts.Modify    set_ue simulated id=2    cell=1
    wts.Modify    ue_param id=2            ue_nr_capabilities=${SA_Capa_4CC}

    wts.Save Wts Cfg              ${resultBaseDir}/basic_wts_CB006139_AA_t3.cfg
    Log To Console    wts cfg saved as ${resultBaseDir}/basic_wts_CB006139_AA_t3.cfg
    Upload Wts Cfg File     ${resultBaseDir}/basic_wts_CB006139_AA_t3.cfg


